 保持风格：\n- Change to daytime while maintaining the same style of the painting\n- 保持画风不变，换到白天\n\n### 2. 风格转换\n**原则：**\n- 明确命名风格：\n- Transform to Bauhaus art style\n- 转变为包豪斯艺术风格\n- 描述特征：\n- Transform to oil painting with visible brushstrokes, thick paint texture\n- 转变为油画，笔触清晰，颜料质感厚重\n- 保留构图：\n- Change to Bauhaus style while maintaining the original composition\n- 保持原有构图，改为包豪斯风格\n\n### 3. 角色一致性\n**框架：**\n- 具体描述：\n- The woman with short black hair 而非\"她\"\n- 黑色短发女人  而非\"她\"\n- 保留特征：\n- while maintaining the same facial features, hairstyle, and expression\n- 保持相同的面部特征、发型和表情\n\n- 分步修改：先改背景，再改动作\n\n### 4. 文本编辑\n- 使用引号：`\"Replace 'joy' with 'BFL'\"`\n- 保持格式：`\"Replace text while maintaining the same font style\"`\n\n## 常见问题解决\n\n### 角色变化过大\n- ❌ 错误：\n- Transform the person into a Viking\n- 把人变成维京人\n- ✅ 正确：\n- Change the clothes to be a viking warrior while preserving facial features\n- 更换衣服，成为一名维京战士，同时保留面部特征\n### 构图位置改变\n- ❌ 错误：\n- Put him on a beach\n- 把他放在沙滩上\n- ✅ 正确：\n- Change the background to a beach while keeping the person in the exact same position, scale, and pose\n- 将背景更改为海滩，同时保持人物处于完全相同的位置、比例和姿势\n### 风格应用不准确\n- ❌ 错误：\n- Make it a sketch\n- 将其绘制成草图\n- ✅ 正确：\n- Convert to pencil sketch with natural graphite lines, cross-hatching, and visible paper texture\n- 转换为具有自然石墨线、交叉影线和可见纸张纹理的铅笔素描\n\n\n\n## 核心原则\n\n1. **具体明确** - 使用精确描述，避免模糊词汇\n2. **分步编辑** - 复杂修改分为多个简单步骤\n3. **明确保留** - 说明哪些要保持不变\n4. **动词选择** - 用\"更改\"、\"替换\"而非\"转换\"\n\n## 最佳实践模板\n\n**对象修改：**\n- Change [object] to [new state], keep [content to preserve] unchanged\n- 将[对象]更改为[新状态]，保持[要保留的内容]不变\n\n**风格转换：**\n- Transform to [specific style], while maintaining [composition/character/other] unchanged\n- 转换为[特定风格]，同时保持[构图/角色/其他]不变\n\n**背景替换：**\n- Change the background to [new background], keep the subject in the exact same position and pose\n- 将背景更改为[新背景]，保持主体处于完全相同的位置和姿势\n\n**文本编辑：**\n- Replace '[original text]' with '[new text]', maintain the same font style\n- 将“[原始文本]”替换为“[新文本]”，保持相同的字体样式\n\n> **记住：** 越具体越好，Kontext 擅长理解详细指令并保持一致性。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Flux Kontext 提示词技巧", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [528.9592895507812, 1429.5701904296875], "pos": [-1172.130859375, -594.1644287109375], "id": 187, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "workspace_info": {"id": "_s3tJ-8xznRhkzhLuQtSe"}, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.2", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {}, "ds": {"offset": [2486.10199442436, 652.0427210397339], "scale": 0.7247295000000004}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 20, "title": "Group", "bounding": [-614.8073120117188, -174.96253967285156, 2120.23583984375, 997.8986206054688]}], "links": [[664, 448, 0, 444, 0, "MODEL"], [665, 454, 0, 445, 0, "IMAGE"], [666, 442, 0, 445, 1, "VAE"], [667, 452, 0, 446, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [668, 445, 0, 446, 1, "LATENT"], [669, 452, 0, 447, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [670, 446, 0, 449, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [671, 453, 0, 450, 0, "LATENT"], [672, 442, 0, 450, 1, "VAE"], [673, 453, 0, 451, 0, "*"], [674, 441, 0, 452, 0, "CLIP"], [675, 458, 0, 453, 0, "MODEL"], [676, 449, 0, 453, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [677, 447, 0, 453, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [678, 445, 0, 453, 3, "LATENT"], [679, 456, 0, 454, 0, "IMAGE"], [680, 450, 0, 455, 0, "IMAGE"], [681, 444, 0, 458, 0, "MODEL"]], "id": "6126cca7-5947-42fc-bfe5-8c9e7dce84af", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 459, "revision": 0}